WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.011
A loan lands. Forty-two thousand dollars. The agent reads the file, calls the credit-scoring tool, and decides to approve at four point nine percent. And in that moment, a new row slides into the audit spine.

2
00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:25.804
From that one row, four artifacts assemble themselves. A model card. A validation report. The N I S T mapping. The examiner pack.

3
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:31.884
All four converge into a single documentation pack. Examiner-ready. Audit-ready.

4
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:37.911
The next time someone asks how the agent decided, you don't dig. You hand them this.
